  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 761f1ee1822cb4844a3034bb7c1d4011, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::ResidentDefinition
  id: expedition.tor
  displayName: Tor
  description: Carpenter from the expedition into the Unquiet Forest. Lost when the waystone connection broke.
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 34f6a519f6c1b304094d0d38d7c6689a, type: 3}
  rescueLine: Still measuring. I knew someone would come, and I wanted something to show for it.
  arrivalLine: It's built crooked, you know. All of it. Give me a week.
  welcomeLine: There's a hollow in the deep woods where nothing grows, and the ground breathes there. In, out, slow as a sleeper. I lay three nights on this leg listening to it. Whatever is down there is old, and it's what moves the roots. Now, where do you want your planks?
  fallenLine: My tools. Leave them, if you have to. Not me.
  fightLines:
    spotted: []
    behindYou: []
    hurt: []
    won: []
    helpedUp: []
  model: {fileID: 8788668705461976432, guid: 16fd07cae11001b428f7eb54b6857a7b, type: 3}
  raidCompanion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 60d284aaf3c06f24fba9e928940c43c5, type: 2}
  memoryLines: []
  returningLines: []
  jobs:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b33d365bf7bdfe74793c6d3f0f4b33a5, type: 2}
  questLine:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 449fc8864f45d83459f6ef5d2c3d8ea8, type: 2}
    text: Logs are just weight until somebody cuts them true. Give me the Carpenter's work and a lodge by the trees, and I'll keep you in planks while you're out there.
    acceptText: A lodge it is.
    waitingText: The Woodcutter's Lodge, near the trees. Then cut me eight fine planks, so you see what it does.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d215378a9433ba6498ac63dfe30d9cc4, type: 2}
    text: The ward keeps out the worst. Not all of it. Four lengths of palisade between the fire and the trees, and we sleep better.
    acceptText: Four lengths.
    waitingText: Four palisade pieces. Drag them out in a line; they go up like anything else.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b95103f99c217d3489eb46bd97d706d8, type: 2}
    text: More will come through that door, and they'll need a roof and somewhere to set down what they carry. A storage shed and a hut.
    acceptText: A shed and a hut.
    waitingText: A Storage Shed and a Hut.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8de8a5d687692334d85f5fe6c7d944c3, type: 2}
    text: Ore weighs more than any pack. Raise my lodge a tier and I'll draw you a yard for carts. Barrows first.
    acceptText: Show me carts.
    waitingText: My lodge at Tier II, then the Wainwright's Yard, then a barrow from it.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  questLineDone: 
